{{Quote|Nubs can help. Two Poobas are stronger than one.|[[Lys Solay]]|<ref name="Big Pooba Problems" />}}
'''Pooba''' were a bipedal [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] that lived in [[the galaxy]]. They were covered in furry [[Color|blue]] [[hair]] and had multihued [[eye]] color. Two members of the species, [[Nubs]] and [[Barabo]], served the [[Jedi Order]] as a [[Jedi Initiate|Jedi youngling]] and a [[Jedi Master]] during the [[High Republic Era]], respectively. Pooba spoke the [[language]] [[Poobian]].

==Biology and appearance==
Pooba were a bipedal [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] with large furry [[ear]]s. They were covered in a coat of furry [[Color|blue]] [[hair]] and possessed multihued [[eye]] color, including blue<ref name="Meet the Young Jedi" /> and green.<ref name="Big Pooba Problems" /> They also displayed immense strength, being able to hold onto multiple chunks of rocks. While young members of the species were visibly shorter than other bipedal species,<ref name="Meet the Young Jedi" /> Pooba were able to have massive stature as they grew older.<ref name="Big Pooba Problems" /> This blue furry species communicated using the [[language]] [[Poobian]].<ref name="Meet the Young Jedi" />

==Pooba in the galaxy==
{{Quote|That's a Jedi who was a Pooba, just like you.|Lys Solay, to Nubs|<ref name="Nubs Mistake">{{YJA|Nubs's Big Mistake}}</ref>}}
[[File:YJAs2e17-BigPoobaProblemsBestBountyBuddies-thumb.png|right|300px|thumb|Nubs and Zeepohz]]
During the [[High Republic Era]], [[Nubs]] was a [[Jedi Initiate|Jedi youngling]] who served the [[Jedi Order]].<ref name="Meet the Young Jedi" /> Around [[233 BBY]],<ref name="YJA Date">{{YJADate|101A}}</ref> Nubs, along with other younglings, were stationed on the [[planet]] [[Tenoo]], where he continued his training as a [[Jedi]].<ref name="Young Jedi">{{YJA|The Young Jedi}}</ref> While on an exploration mission to an old Jedi temple with [[Grand Master]] [[Yoda]], Nubs encountered a mural of [[Jedi Master]] [[Barabo]], another Pooba Jedi, and subsequently found their [[Barabo's lightsaber|lightsaber]].<ref name="Nubs Mistake" /> At some point later, Nubs encountered an adult Pooba named [[Zeepohz]].<ref name="Big Pooba Problems" />

{{Species-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
{{Quote|Star Wars: Young Jedi Adventures, a High Republic Era series featuring Master Yoda and this little blue cutie named Nubs, who's part of a brand-new species called Pooba.|[[Kristin Baver]]|<ref name="This Week">{{ThisWeek|IeHXbDSPlPo|All the D23 Expo News, a First Look at Phase II of The High Republic, and More!|sw_url=video/all-the-d23-expo-news-a-first-look-at-phase-ii-of-the-high-republic-and-more}}</ref>}}
Pooba are a species created for the ''[[Star Wars: Young Jedi Adventures]]'' television series that was first pictured on the ''[[Star Wars]]'' Twitter account.<ref name="Twitter">{{Twitter|StarWars|status/1568748577681469440|[[Star Wars]]|date=2022-09-11|quote=Incoming transmission. Jamaal Avery Jr. and Emma Berman star as Kai Brightstar and Nash Durango in Star Wars: Young Jedi Adventures coming in 2023.|archiveurl=https://archive.ph/HmJEh}}</ref> They were first identified in an episode of ''[[This Week! in Star Wars]]''.<ref name="This Week" />

